# ==========================================
# HITL Experiment Scenario - Baseline & Conflicts (SHORT)
# Same two trials as 2con_test.scn (head-on @ FL100, then 90 deg crossing
# @ FL150), compressed so both conflicts happen early and the whole run
# fits in a shorter video (ends t=00:02:15 instead of t=00:03:30).
# Manual collision geometry (CRECONFS avoided - see 2con_test.scn).
# ==========================================

# --- System & Camera Initialization ---
# Enable Conflict Detection (crucial for visual alerts on the radar)
00:00:00.00> CDMETHOD ON
# Load the conflict onset/offset logger (see bluesky/plugins/hitl_conflog.py).
00:00:00.00> PLUGIN LOAD HITL_CONFLOG
# Start all four HITL loggers inside the scenario so every run starts
# fresh files (a scenario load resets the sim and closes open loggers).
00:00:00.00> FOVACLOG ON
00:00:00.00> OPCMDLOG ON
00:00:00.00> HITLCONFLOG ON
00:00:00.00> HEARTBEATLOG ON
# Record the whole screen to output/<scn>/<stamp>/<stamp>.mp4, plus a
# SCREENRECLOG CSV mapping simt to video time. See
# bluesky/plugins/hitl_screenrec.py.
00:00:00.00> SCREENREC ON
# Center radar screen on a specific location (lat, lon)
00:00:00.00> PAN 52.0 4.5
# Set initial zoom level to fit the experiment area
00:00:00.00> ZOOM 0.8

# --- Background Traffic (Baseline) ---
# Same as 2con_test.scn: FL180-FL300, clear of the FL100/FL150 conflicts.
00:00:00.00> CRE BGA, B738, 52.8, 3.5, 090, FL200, 300
00:00:00.00> CRE BGB, A320, 51.2, 5.5, 270, FL220, 300
00:00:00.00> CRE BGC, B744, 52.5, 4.8, 180, FL300, 350
00:00:00.00> CRE BGD, MD11, 51.5, 3.8, 360, FL180, 280

# ==========================================
# Trial 1: Head-On Conflict (180 deg, dpsi) @ FL100
# ==========================================
# Both spawned at t=0, each 250kt*60s = 4.17 NM (0.1128 deg lon at 52N)
# from the meeting point 52.0000N 3.6000E, which they reach together at
# t=00:01:00. Initial separation 8.33 NM, so it alerts at once but is
# not yet a loss of separation.
00:00:00.00> CRE TARGA, B738, 52.0000, 3.4872, 090, FL100, 250
00:00:00.00> CRE INTRUDA, B738, 52.0000, 3.7128, 270, FL100, 250

# ==========================================
# Trial 2: Crossing Conflict (90 deg, dpsi) @ FL150
# ==========================================
# TARGB flies due north (360), INTRUDB due east (090), both at 250 kt.
# Spawned at t=00:01:00 (as trial 1 meets) and each placed 250kt*75s =
# 5.21 NM from the shared meeting point (51.6042N 5.0000E), so they cross
# at a right angle at t=00:02:15, same altitude (FL150). Initial
# separation 7.37 NM.
00:01:00.00> CRE TARGB, A320, 51.5174, 5.0000, 360, FL150, 250
00:01:00.00> CRE INTRUDB, A320, 51.6042, 4.8602, 090, FL150, 250
